From e52d680ccaf9f06ac3c1bdb5d9be9aef58399bcd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Weidong Sun <sunweidong@linux.alibaba.com>
Date: Wed, 26 Aug 2026 12:02:05 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] fix(node): publish atomic readonly direct-volume metadata

Define the strict v1 host-to-CAA contract, derive readonly from every CSI source, and publish it with file and directory fsync. Preserve the existing upstream CDH key-reference fields without exposing credentials or adding any CryptPilot-specific metadata.

Signed-off-by: Weidong Sun <sunweidong@linux.alibaba.com>
